Never to a player.
Correct:
PlayerA + PlayerB
Incorrect:
PlayerA
==================================================
COUPLE IDENTIFIER
=================
UUID_A::UUID_B
UUIDs must be sorted.
This guarantees:
A+B = B+A
==================================================
ARCHITECTURE CONTRACTS
======================
CONTRACT 001
Relationship belongs to couple.
CONTRACT 002
UUID only internally.
CONTRACT 003
Only core.sk modifies relationship data.
CONTRACT 004
Only cooldowns.sk modifies cooldowns.
CONTRACT 005
Only requests.sk modifies requests.
CONTRACT 006
Modules communicate using functions.
CONTRACT 007
Points belong to couple.
CONTRACT 008
Stages belong to couple.
CONTRACT 009
NOIVOS and CASADOS are event stages.
CONTRACT 010
All consent uses:

/ls
/ln

CONTRACT 011
Bedrock compatibility required.
CONTRACT 012
Cooldowns must survive restart.
